v0.1.2 First release. The CLI has been buildable since it was
       scaffolded but never had its VERSION bumped, so the release
       gate - which fires only on a change to this file - never
       opened and no assets were ever published.

       Numbered v0.1.2 rather than v0.1.0 because tags are shared
       with the TUI, which already holds v0.1.0 and v0.1.1. Reusing
       one would attach these assets to that release and overwrite
       its checksums.txt, since both tools write that name.

v0.0.1 Initial release
